### Telegram Bot Settings
### Get token from @BotFather
TELEGRAM_API_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
### Comma separated numeric user IDs (not usernames)
TELEGRAM_ADMINS_ID=11111111

### Traffic Monitor (runs every hour at minute 00)
TRAFFIC_MONITOR_ENABLED=false
TRAFFIC_MONITOR_ALERT_PERCENT=80
